---
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../config";
import BackgroundEffects from "../layouts/BackgroundEffects.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>SKIL3 Cloudway Project | {siteConfig.name}</title>
  </head>

  <body class="bg-transparent text-white md:pl-24">
    <BackgroundEffects />
    <Header />

    <main>
      <!-- HERO -->
      <section
        class="relative overflow-hidden pt-40 pb-24 px-6 sm:px-10 md:px-16 lg:px-24"
      >
        <!-- glow -->
        <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10">
          <div
            class="absolute top-24 left-24 h-[28rem] w-[28rem] rounded-full blur-3xl animate-glow-slow"
            style="background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12)"
          >
          </div>
          <div
            class="absolute bottom-0 right-10 h-[30rem] w-[30rem] rounded-full blur-3xl animate-glow-slow"
            style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)"
          >
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
            <!-- TEXT -->
            <div class="md:col-span-7">
              <span
                class="font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-xs text-[rgba(245,158,11,0.8)]"
              >
                SKIL3 • Cloudway • 2024
              </span>

              <h1 class="mt-6 text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold leading-[1.05]">
                Logic Unit<br /> Integration Platform
              </h1>

              <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-white/60 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
                A system-to-system integration platform built for Cloudway that
                enables structured AI-driven logic execution, API orchestration,
                and multi-service communication through a unified Logic Unit
                engine.
              </p>

              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-10">
                {
                  [
                    "Node.js",
                    "TypeScript",
                    "AWS",
                    "OAuth2",
                    "Microservices",
                    "APIs",
                  ].map((t) => (
                    <span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 text-sm text-white/70">
                      {t}
                    </span>
                  ))
                }
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- IMAGE -->
            <div class="md:col-span-4">
              <div
                class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-white/5"
              >
                <img
                  src="/images/cloudway.png"
                  alt="Cloudway Logo"
                  class="w-full h-auto object-contain"
                />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- OVERVIEW -->
      <section class="px-6 sm:px-10 md:px-16 lg:px-24 pb-24">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold">Project Overview</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-[2px] mt-4 bg-[rgba(245,158,11,0.6)] rounded-full">
          </div>

          <div class="mt-12 space-y-10 text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">
                Client — Cloudway
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                This project was developed for Cloudway (Corda Campus, Hasselt).
                The goal was to build an intelligent integration layer for their
                Logic Unit system, allowing AI-driven reasoning to interact with
                external services in a structured and secure way.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Team Structure</h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                The project team consisted of <b>7 students</b> in total:
                <b>4 AI students</b>, <b>2 CCS students</b>, and myself as the <b
                  >Application Development (APP) student</b
                >. I was solely responsible for the full APP scope, including
                API design, backend implementation, integration logic, and
                deployment configuration.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">My Role</h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                I acted as <b>Group Lead and Scrum Master</b>, coordinating
                sprint planning, task distribution, and communication between
                technical and non-technical team members. I also ensured
                alignment between the AI logic outputs and the application
                layer.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Core Concept</h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                The Logic Unit transforms natural language into structured
                facts, processes them through a reasoning engine, and returns
                validated outputs. The system supports APIs, webhooks,
                authentication flows, and multi-modal inputs such as text and
                documents.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- IMAGE / CAROUSEL -->
      <div class="md:col-span-12">
        <div class="relative group w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto">
          <div
            id="cloudwayCarousel"
            class="flex gap-4 overflow-x-auto scroll-smooth snap-x snap-mandatory scrollbar-hide
             rounded-4xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5"
          >
            {
              [
                "/images/Cloudway1.png",
                "/images/Cloudway2.png",
                "/images/Cloudway3.png",
                "/images/Cloudway4.png",
                "/images/Cloudway5.png",
                "/images/Cloudway6.png",
                "/images/Cloudway7.png",
                "/images/Cloudway8.png",
              ].map((src) => (
                <div class="min-w-full snap-center flex items-center justify-center p-3">
                  <img
                    src={src}
                    alt="Cloudway architecture screenshot"
                    class="w-full max-h-[350px] object-contain rounded-xl"
                  />
                </div>
              ))
            }
          </div>

          <!-- LEFT ARROW -->
          <button
            onclick="document.getElementById('cloudwayCarousel').scrollBy({ left: -300, behavior: 'smooth' })"
            class="absolute left-2 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-30
             w-10 h-10 rounded-full
             bg-black/50 hover:bg-black/80
             border border-white/10
             flex items-center justify-center
             opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition
             backdrop-blur"
          >
            ‹
          </button>

          <!-- RIGHT ARROW -->
          <button
            onclick="document.getElementById('cloudwayCarousel').scrollBy({ left: 300, behavior: 'smooth' })"
            class="absolute right-2 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-30
             w-10 h-10 rounded-full
             bg-black/50 hover:bg-black/80
             border border-white/10
             flex items-center justify-center
             opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition
             backdrop-blur"
          >
            ›
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- TECHNICAL -->
      <section class="px-6 sm:px-10 md:px-16 lg:px-24 pb-32">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold">Technical Implementation</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-[2px] mt-4 bg-[rgba(245,158,11,0.6)] rounded-full">
          </div>

          <div class="mt-12 space-y-10 text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">
                Logic Unit Engine
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                The core engine converts natural language into structured facts,
                which are processed using a rule-based reasoning system. Outputs
                can be returned as natural language or structured JSON tool
                results for downstream services.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">
                API & Integration Layer
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                A unified API Gateway exposes endpoints for communication with
                the Logic Unit. It supports both simple message-based requests
                and structured context-driven inputs for advanced integration
                scenarios.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Security</h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                Authentication is handled using OAuth2 (Azure AD), with
                short-lived access tokens and secured API Gateway routing for
                all requests.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">
                Deployment & Monitoring
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                The system is containerized and deployed on AWS using CI/CD
                pipelines. Monitoring includes logging, uptime tracking, and
                request performance analysis.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
